\p{
  My name is 黄栩 (\em{Huang, Xu}), but I go by the name \em{Trebor} online. I’m interested in the syntax and semantics of dependent type theory, in particular homotopy type theory and cubical type theory.
}

\p{
  I am currently a PhD student at Indiana University Bloomington, supervised by [[angiuli]]. I graduated from Tsinghua University.
}

